    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这两个命题，我们不加证明而承认它们的正确性，并且简单地叙述成：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "这两个命题，我们不加证明而承认它们的正确性，并且简单地叙述成：",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**7 三点属于一条直线当且仅当其中的一点在另外两点之间．\n**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "**7 三点属于一条直线当且仅当其中的一点在另外两点之间．**",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用命题7来证明下面的定理．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "利用命题7来证明下面的定理．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**8 定理（三角形不等式）．\n如果$A$、$B$和$C$不属于一条直线，那么距离$|AC|$小于距离$|AB|$与$|BC|$的和．\n**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "**8 定理（三角形不等式）．如果$A$、$B$和$C$不属于一条直线，那么距离$|AC|$小于距离$|AB|$与$|BC|$的和．**",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明．\n设点$A$、$B$和$C$不在一条直线上（参看图11，b）．\n由距离的第三条性质得",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "证明．设点$A$、$B$和$C$不在一条直线上（参看图11，б）．由距离的第三条性质得",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|AC|\\leqslant|AB|+|BC|$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$|AC|\\leqslant|AB|+|BC|$，",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "也就是说，要么$|AC|<|AB|+|BC|$，要么$|AC|=|AB|+|BC|$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#7"
      ],
      "source_text": "也就是说，要么$|AC|<|AB|+|BC|$，要么$|AC|=|AB|+|BC|$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "但是等式$|AC|=|AB|+|BC|$不可能成立．\n因为这个等式成立意味着点$B$在$A$和$C$两点之间．\n于是（由命题7）点$A$、$B$和$C$就应当属于同一条直线．\n\n这和已知条件矛盾．\n因此，$|AC|<|AB|+|BC|$．\n$\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 14,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0024#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "但是等式$|AC|=|AB|+|BC|$不可能成立．因为这个等式成立意味着点$B$在$A$和$C$两点之间．于是（由命题7）点$A$、$B$和$C$就应当属于同一条直线．这和已知条件矛盾．因此，$|AC|<|AB|+|BC|$．$\\blacksquare$",
